## RootmannWright was here. This is a .gitignore file for a JavaScript/TypeScript RESTful API project. It specifies files and directories that should be ignored by Git.


## Ignore TypeScript build output
dist/

## Ignore all log files
*.log

## Ignore node_modules
node_modules/
package-lock.json
package.json
tsconfig.json

## Ignore IDE specific files
.vscode/
.idea/

## Archives and binaries (not suitable for git)
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.exe
*.7z
hydra.restore

## Temporary files
*.tmp
*.bak

## Ignore OS specific files
.DS_Store

## Ignore environment variable files
.env

## Ignore files generated by npm
npm-debug.log*


## Jest archives
coverage/
test-results/
test-results.xml
test-results.json